      "content": "here is the section i'm talking about. it's from the leader of the G7 and the response from the EU rep. look at how they both use the phrase \"unprecedented coordination\" and how they both do that little half-second pause right after mentioning \"supply chain resilience.\" it's not just coincidence, right? it's too synchronized. \n\n[Transcript Snippet:\nLeader A: \"In these times, we must ensure unprecedented coordination across all sectors. (pause) It is vital that we protect our supply chain resilience to maintain order.\"\nLeader B: \"We agree. There is a need for unprecedented coordination. (pause) Without supply chain resilience, the framework collapses.\"\n]",
